{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01FkLa8eFdJxmYSPvvvzfHvQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Let me search for more specific topics I need for the five slots:\n\n1. Arias intensity formulas\n2. CAV formulas and use in liquefaction\n3. Significant duration for blast records\n4. Cyclic mobility and fine tailings\n5. Response spectra and Fourier spectra for blast records\n6. The CANLEX project and blast-induced pore pressure measurements\n7. Frequency and cycle count for pore-pressure accumulation\n\nLet me also look for specific papers that will be highly useful:\n- Rollins et al. (2004/2005) on blast-induced pore pressure\n- Scott et al. on blast-induced pore pressure\n- Charlie et al. - blast pore pressure in sand\n- Atkinson & Goda (2011) on intensity measures\n- Green et al. on CAV\n- Kramer & Mitchell on energy-based liquefaction\n- Dobry et al. (1982) on threshold strain\n\nNow I'll do more targeted searches to find these specific references.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1844,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3572,"cache_read_input_tokens":58960,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3572,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":28,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7d52a3ef-833c-4d3d-a19f-380d6d5297be","uuid":"d70efb7b-20e8-4627-88e7-379c96c6075f","request_id":"req_011CcmB9NDDcUmjR7UnZz8cV"}
